      "category": "Geological",
      "dataStructures": [
        "Vector"
      ],
      "description": [
        "BGS GeoCoast Open contains a detailed suite of statistical data based on the underlying datasets (GeoCoast Premium). These include, for example, percentage of county at threat from inundation and percentage of county coastline with high susceptibility to erosion. In addition, there is a tool to compare or share best practise at a regional scale and streamline the consideration of multiple underlying datasets through a simple, high-level scheme, presented as domains.",
        "GeoCoast Open consists of: regional statistics (shapefiles); coastal domains for erosion and morphology."
      ],
      "documentationUrl": "https://www.bgs.ac.uk/datasets/geocoast-open/",
      "downloadsUrl": "https://api.os.uk/downloads/v1/products/GeoCoast_Open/downloads",
      "formats": [
        {
          "format": "ESRI® Shapefile"
        }
      ],
      "id": "GeoCoast_Open",
      "name": "BGS GeoCoast Open",
      "supportingInfo": [
        {
          "link": "https://www.bgs.ac.uk/download/bgs-geocoast-user-guide/?wpdmdl=83617&amp;refresh=65e19e268bfba1709284902",
          "name": "User Guide"
        }
      ],
      "url": "https://api.os.uk/downloads/v1/products/GeoCoast_Open",
      "version": "Version 1"
    },
    {
      "areas": [
        "GB"
